# Xan's Space Tools Feature Roadmap
*Your Complete Star Citizen Trading Companion*

---

## 🎉 **Currently Available Features**

### 📊 **Trading Dashboard**
✅ Real-time commodity prices from all terminals  
✅ View buy/sell prices across the universe  
✅ Find the best trading opportunities  
✅ Filter by commodity type  
✅ Historical price tracking  

### 🛣️ **Trade Routes**
✅ Find profitable trade routes instantly  
✅ Filter routes by profit, distance, and investment  
✅ Terminal selection (choose your starting location)  
✅ Stock availability indicators  
✅ Calculate profit per SCU  
✅ Live/PTU game version switching  

### 🏪 **Marketplace** ✅ Complete
✅ Browse community marketplace listings (2M+ cached locally!)  
✅ Lightning-fast search (instant results from cache)  
✅ Filter by operation (Buy/Sell/Trade/Rent)  
✅ Search by item name, username, ID, or slug  
✅ Create your own listings (full production support)  
✅ Manage your active listings  
✅ Delete listings  
✅ View listing details with high-quality images  
✅ Contact sellers directly  
✅ Production/Sandbox mode for listings  
✅ Message buyers/sellers (full chat system)  
✅ View negotiations and active deals  
✅ Send and receive messages  

### 💬 **Spectrum Community**
✅ Browse RSI Spectrum forums in-app  
✅ Full browser navigation controls  
✅ No need to switch to your web browser!  

### 🎯 **Erkul DPS Calculator**
✅ Build ship loadouts in-app  
✅ Compare weapon DPS  
✅ Full Erkul.games integration  
✅ Seamless experience  

### ⚙️ **Settings**
✅ Configure your UEX API key  
✅ Set up your Secret Key for marketplace  
✅ Manage marketplace cache (clear/resync)  
✅ View sync status and cached listing count  
✅ Overlay controls  
✅ Hotkey configuration

### 🖥️ **In-Game Overlay System** ✅ Complete
✅ Trading price overlays (customizable)  
✅ Trade routes overlays  
✅ Marketplace overlays  
✅ Overlay manager (show/hide all)  
✅ Configuration overlays  
✅ Hotkey management  
✅ Spectrum overlay  
✅ Erkul DPS calculator overlay  
✅ Drag and resize windows  
✅ Custom colors and opacity  
✅ Persistent positioning  
✅ Global and per-overlay hotkeys  

